---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Privacy Policy | CharCraft" description="Privacy Policy for CharCraft. Read how we protect your security and process images strictly on the client side.">
  <div class="content-container">
    <div class="header-section">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Effective date: July 4, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="glass-card privacy-body">
      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>1. Client-Side Image Processing Guarantee</h2>
        <p>
          At CharCraft, accessible from our GitHub Pages site, one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. 
          All image conversions, processing, and renders are executed **strictly client-side in your local web browser**. 
          We do not upload, copy, store, or transmit your images to any external servers or backend databases. 
          Once you close your browser tab, all image data is instantly cleared from your system memory.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>2. Data Collection and Usage</h2>
        <p>
          Because our tool is entirely static, we do not require user accounts, email registration, or log-in details. 
          We do not collect personal identifiable information (PII). We do not track image upload histories or download logs.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>3. Third-Party Advertising and Cookies (AdSense)</h2>
        <p>
          CharCraft may implement third-party advertising services, such as Google AdSense, to display advertisements. 
          These networks may use cookies, web beacons, or tracking pixels to serve ads based on your visits to this website and other sites on the Internet.
        </p>
        <p>
          Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to our users based on their visit to our site and/or other sites on the Internet. 
          Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google's Ad Settings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>4. Log Files</h2>
        <p>
          Like many other websites, CharCraft's hosting platform (GitHub Pages) may collect standard server logs. 
          These logs include internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date/time stamp, referring/exit pages, and number of clicks. 
          This information is not linked to any information that is personally identifiable and is used solely for analyzing trends, administering the site, and tracking aggregate user movement.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>5. Consent</h2>
        <p>
          By using our website, you hereby consent to our Privacy Policy and agree to its terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>6. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have additional questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact us through our Contact Page.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .content-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem 0 3rem 0;
  }

  .header-section {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .subtitle {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0.5rem auto 0 auto;
  }

  .privacy-body {
    padding: 2.5rem;
    border-color: var(--border-color);
  }

  .privacy-section {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .privacy-section:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .privacy-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .privacy-section p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
</style>
